<!--
  Pocket Prose's launcher icon: three sheets of paper, seen from above and slightly to one side.

  Converted by hand from assets/icon_mk1.svg, which is the editable source and is not in this
  repository. Re-export from there rather than editing the path data below.

  The colours are NOT the app's UI palette. That palette is deliberately low-contrast (see
  ui/Theme.kt) and low contrast is exactly wrong for a 48dp tile on somebody's wallpaper, so the
  same two hues are used at icon strength: the sheets lift well clear of the ground and the page
  edges are near-white. The ground itself is a flat colour in values/ic_launcher_background.xml.

  Artwork is scaled into the adaptive icon's safe zone — the centre 74 of 108dp — so no launcher
  mask, round or squircle, can clip a corner off the stack.
-->
